{"label": "bug", "route": "engineering", "draft": "Thank you for reporting this regression in CSV export functionality between versions 2.3 and 2.4. We’ve confirmed that when creating three records and exporting via 'Export CSV', only the first two rows are included in the download despite the UI showing all three. This behavior was not present in 2.3 and persists across fresh browser sessions, indicating a likely backend or frontend rendering issue introduced in the recent release.

Our engineering team will investigate the export logic—particularly around record iteration, pagination, or buffer handling—to identify why the final record is being omitted. We’ll prioritize a fix in an upcoming patch and keep you updated on progress.

Please let us know if you observe similar behavior with other export formats (e.g., Excel, JSON) or if the issue occurs with different record counts.", "needs_review": false}
